## A streamlined .gitignore for modern .NET projects
## including temporary files, build results, and
## files generated by popular .NET tools. If you are
## developing with Visual Studio, the VS .gitignore
## https://github.com/github/gitignore/blob/main/VisualStudio.gitignore
## has more thorough IDE-specific entries.
##
## Get latest from https://github.com/github/gitignore/blob/main/Dotnet.gitignore

# Build results
[Dd]ebug/
[Dd]ebugPublic/
[Rr]elease/
[Rr]eleases/
x64/
x86/
[Ww][Ii][Nn]32/
[Aa][Rr][Mm]/
[Aa][Rr][Mm]64/
bld/
[Bb]in/
[Oo]bj/
[Ll]og/
[Ll]ogs/

# .NET Core
project.lock.json
project.fragment.lock.json
# Local build outputs under artifacts/ (allow ci-drop-into-game for cloud release)
artifacts/*
!artifacts/ci-drop-into-game/
!artifacts/ci-drop-into-game/**

# ASP.NET Scaffolding
ScaffoldingReadMe.txt

# NuGet Packages
*.nupkg
# NuGet Symbol Packages
*.snupkg

# dotenv environment variables file
.env

# Others
~$*
*~
CodeCoverage/

# MSBuild Binary and Structured Log
*.binlog

# MSTest test Results
[Tt]est[Rr]esult*/
[Bb]uild[Ll]og.*

# NUnit
*.VisualState.xml
TestResult.xml
nunit-*.xml

# RPG runtime (never commit)
# Live DB is next to the server exe: {exe}/data/rpg-hot.sqlite + rpg-media.sqlite
**/dist/
**/data/icons/

**/node_modules/
**/dist/

# Local study clones (never commit)
study/

# Local IL/Cecil dumps (not product source)
_cecil_dump/

# Web test outputs
web/fusion-rpg-web/coverage/
**/playwright-report/
**/test-results/
**/blob-report/
**/e2e/.artifacts/
_tmp_reflect/
src/FusionRpg.Injector/CheatMenuGui.Legacy.cs.bak

# Third-party Claude agent skills (addyosmani/agent-skills) — vendored locally, not committed.
# Update: git -C .claude/vendor/agent-skills pull
#         cp -r .claude/vendor/agent-skills/skills/. .claude/skills/
.claude/vendor/
# Machine-local assistant overrides only; the rest of the assistant config is tracked
.claude/settings.local.json
.claude/worktrees/
.kilo/worktrees/

**/artifacts/perf-build/

**/__pycache__/

# Python build/venv artifacts — seedsmith became an installable package (pyproject.toml, 2026-09-01)
**/*.egg-info/
**/.venv/
**/.venv-*/
**/wwwroot/
**/.playwright-mcp/
**/.pytest_cache/
.remember/
**/artifacts/

/data/seed/creatures/_runs/

# Action-corpus mid pipeline (pre-acceptance scratch / A-P3 briefs). Final delivery stays
# tracked: committed-round-*.json, _briefs/, _reports/, _generated/, _rounds/*/survivors.json
# (+ rejects/review-queue/assembled), and *_runs/*.ledger.json.
/data/seed/actions/_candidates/
/data/seed/actions/_rounds/**/p3-briefs.json

*sqlite-shm
*.sqlite-wal
*.log
*.sqlite
.worldmap-playtest-build/

# tree-review per-tree cards (task H6/H7, spec-tree-review.md §5.6) — regenerated from the
# committed plan + concrete catalog, never committed themselves. The corpus sheet and the verdict
# queue are the opposite: docs/research/passive-tree/_review/ and
# data/seed/passive-tree/_review/ are the review's own permanent record and stay tracked.
/.review/
data-out.txt
*.bak-*
